| PMM.MDS2.Plum.Chenrui02.C454426 | `2c6d0899-fd74-f111-ac9a-0022482dcc01` | Medusa2 | 10.67.186.77 |
| PMM.STXH.BR4.4.14.C359914 | `c260f53b-3e7f-f111-b337-000d3a187ade` | Strix Halo | 10.67.193.23 |
| PMM.GNR.BR4.4.06.C468968 | `1c4e0c3f-b87a-f111-b339-0022482b3a20` | Granite Ridge | 10.67.221.2 |

### apex_get_test_station 返回字段映射

`apex_get_test_station(test_station_id)` 返回的字段非常丰富，与 APEX GUI 字段对应如下：

| GUI 字段 | API 字段路径 | 示例值 |
|----------|-------------|--------|
