Choose the answer that unlimited doubting is possible. The feedback says the doubter must trust "that the things she doubts about exist". Ordinary doubts about existence contradict this criterion. OC section 20 expressly distinguishes a qu…199 tokens truncated…17/play/hinges (`h1-1` through `h2-5`); `src/games/choice/ChoiceGame.tsx:59`. Evidence: `qa/codex-review-r1/phone/062-session-the-beetle.png`, `064-session-the-diary.png`, `065-session-doubt-it.png`, `066-session-the-river-bed.png`; desktop equivalents in `desktop/journey.json`.

